Abstract = {The possibility of existence of exohedral organometallic complexes of
   fullerenes larger than C-60 in which their coordination can have eta(6)
   hapticity was studied from a theoretical point of view. Complexes
   containing C-70, C-74 or C-60 cages, as well as cyclopentadienyl (Cp),
   pentamethyl-cyclopentadienyl (Me5Cp), benzene rings and
   hexamethyl-phenyl (Me6Ph) fragments as ligands, were designed and
   studied. The results show that many of these molecules can be
   thermodynamically stable and can have electronic interesting behavior.},
