Abstract = {A study of the soft x-ray emission is presented, for a low energy (4.8
   kJ) dense plasma focus device. Three Quantrad Si PIN-diodes with
   differential filter combinations of Be, Al, Ti, Ni, and Mo are employed
   as time-resolved x-ray detectors. The x-ray flux in different energy
