   from Asia, and it differs from other species by the presence of 4+4
   setae on ventral tube, as the American species, but shows nine tubercles
   between setae p1-p1 on Abd. IV and has the unguiculus as a minute
   bristle. A key for the six species now known in the genus is given.},
