Abstract = {Photoxic compounds (polyacetylenes and thiophenes) and their biological
   activity were determined on Bidens squarrosa plants by measuring their
   antibacterial and anti-inflammatory potential. Phototoxic compounds were
   extracted with hexane, characterized by TLC, and their presence
   confirmed by U.V. spectrum of their extracts and bactericidal potential.
