   acetoclastic and methylotrophic pathways), and concluded that each of
   these pathways, and every different enzyme or subunit (in the case of
   multimeric enzymes), has their own intricate evolutionary history. Our
   study supports the scenario of hydrogenotrophic methanogenesis being
   older than the other variants, albeit not old enough to be present in
