   Hamiltonian functions
   H = 1/2 (p(X)(2) + p(Y)(2) + X-2 + Y-2) + a/5 X-5 + bX(3)Y(2),
   where the first term consist of a harmonic oscillator and the second
   term are homogeneous polynomials of degree 5 defined by two real
